<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Faber year net down 29 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Faber year net down 29 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to June 30</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		 104.50   vs	 146.30</p>
<p>    Shr	 (cents)	  8.8    vs	  17.3</p>
<p>    Turnover		   153.49   vs	 172.96</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	   109.15   vs	 150.12</p>
<p>    Minorities	   less  0.63   vs   add   0.17</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries    add 828.95   vs   less  3.60</p>
<p>    Dividend			nil   vs	   nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Malaysia's Faber Group Bhd is involved in hotels and property business.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
</text>
